Pennywise demo data notice

The sample files, merchant seed rules and offline mock answers in this repository
are derived from the open dataset:

  DoDataThings/us-bank-transaction-categories-v2
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/DoDataThings/us-bank-transaction-categories-v2
  Pinned commit: 3e8d052cb7b362fb1a04b6064d2331982553ea56
  License: MIT

The dataset is synthetic (it imitates real US bank statement formats) and contains
no real people's data. The raw file is downloaded by scripts/fetch_data.py into
data/raw/ and is not committed. Dates and amounts in samples/ are generated by
scripts/build_samples.py with a fixed random seed, because the dataset has neither.

